              "id": "SC-2-LogViewerViewModel-loadMessages",
              "metric": "SC-2",
              "severity": "SEVERE",
              "description": "Task.detached created in loadMessages() at line 122 has no stored handle and no cancellation path. Its .value is awaited inline, but Task.detached does not inherit cancellation from the calling Task — if the caller (e.g. SwiftUI .task modifier) is cancelled while parsing is in flight, the detached parse continues to completion. Either store the handle and cancel it from a cleanup site, or replace Task.detached with a child task that inherits cancellation (e.g. an async let or a TaskGroup), or run parser work on a background actor.",
              "line_start": 122,
              "line_end": 129
